Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episod}
Comment: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:28.29,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.78,0:00:09.49,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ce vreme frumoasă, nu-i așa, Mameko?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.03,0:00:14.74,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Oh, Kitami!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:15.16,0:00:16.66,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.58,0:00:20.12,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Oh, Mikasa. Bună!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.67,0:00:25.13,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am dat nas în nas cu Kitami... \NOare e asta mâna destinului?!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:25.88,0:00:29.88,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1\t(2980,3980,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}După acea zi, mă \Nholbez încontinuu la el!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.88,0:00:32.30,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sunt îndrăgostită lulea de el!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.30,0:00:33.39,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Simt că leșin!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:33.68,0:00:37.14,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce se petrece?! Afecțiunea ei \Na crescut de la un simplu „bună”!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:37.14,0:00:38.27,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}De ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.35,0:00:42.36,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Câinele tău este un Shiba, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.36,0:00:44.77,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Da, o cheamă Mameko.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.77,0:00:47.61,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Al tău este un \NGolden Retriever, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:47.61,0:00:50.15,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Da! Îl cheamă Ciocolată!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.15,0:00:52.41,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ce nume drăguț.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.95,0:00:54.66,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Tu i l-ai pus?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.41,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Cum ți-ai dat seama?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:56.74,0:01:00.42,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Se potrivește cu personalitatea \Nta drăguță, bănuiesc...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:00.42,0:01:02.54,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,D-Drăguță?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.54,0:01:05.63,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}A spus că sunt drăguță! De două ori!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:05.63,0:01:06.92,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oare va fi...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.92,0:01:09.30,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}exact ca în banda desene pentru \Nfete pe care am citit-o ieri,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.30,0:01:11.38,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}unde doi câini devin cei mai buni prieteni...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:11.38,0:01:14.51,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}iar apoi stăpânii lor \Najung să fie împreună...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:14.51,0:01:17.43,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Asta urmează să se întâmple?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:19.27,0:01:22.02,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fir-ar. Afecțiunea ei \Na ajuns la maximum.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.02,0:01:24.23,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dar inima mea îi aparține lui Marika!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:24.23,0:01:26.07,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu o pot face să se \Nîndrăgostească de mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.61,0:01:28.69,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Mă pot juca cu Ciocolată?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.69,0:01:29.99,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Ei bine, da.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:29.99,0:01:31.32,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Mersi!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:31.70,0:01:34.78,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Haide, Ciocolată, \Nsă alergăm puțin!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:36.99,0:01:38.20,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Kitami?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:38.20,0:01:40.46,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Ești bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.04,0:01:40.91,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\an8}Au, fața mea...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.71,0:01:44.46,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}S-a împiedicat și acum plânge...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.13,0:01:47.80,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu așa ar trebui să se comporte un erou \Ndintr-o bandă desenată pentru fete...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.80,0:01:49.71,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Afecțiunea a scăzut \Nîntr-un mod brutal!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.38,0:01:52.47,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oricum... totul a mers \Nconform planului!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.88,0:01:55.39,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Bun, Ciocolată, haide să \Nne mai jucăm puțin, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.10,0:01:59.22,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Ciocolată?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.60,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ești bine, Mikasa?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:05.10,0:02:06.19,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.48,0:02:09.65,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Ar fi rău dacă aș cădea din nou, deci...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.65,0:02:11.94,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,m-ai putea ține de mână?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:11.94,0:02:14.74,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}La naiba! Iar a ajuns la maximum!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.74,0:02:16.95,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Hm, nu. E prea jenant.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.95,0:02:19.70,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Latura sa timidă e așa de drăguță!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:19.70,0:02:23.54,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Afecțiunea ei a depășit maximumul \Nși a apărut un al doilea termometru?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.83,0:02:27.42,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Încetează, Ciocolată!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.42,0:02:28.92,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Dacă vei face asta...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.42,0:02:31.92,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Vei deveni tătic!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.47,0:02:34.93,Dialogue,SUMO,0,0,0,,Ah, murim, murim! Trăim!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.27,0:02:47.69,Dialogue,SUMO,0,0,0,,Murim, murim, murim!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.69,0:02:52.61,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu... Nu se poate!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.15,0:02:55.95,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se înțelege așa de bine cu Kokona...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:55.95,0:02:59.83,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1\t(2855,4090,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Lucrurile se întâmplă exact ca în \Nacea bandă desenată pentru fete...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:06.04,0:03:08.38,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Cățelușii sunt așa drăgălași.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.38,0:03:10.38,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Da. Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.38,0:03:14.05,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Văzându-ne cățeii alături de \Ncățelușii lor, mă face să vreau...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.18,0:03:21.18,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Și eu vreau. \NCât mai mulți.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.90,0:03:31.65,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Kanata…
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.69,0:03:34.65,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ești foarte frumoasă...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.65,0:03:36.32,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Kokona…
Dialogue: 99,0:03:36.32,0:03:37.41,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ești pregătită?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.74,0:03:40.95,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Da, sunt.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:57.30,0:04:00.14,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:03.39,0:04:04.56,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,A-Auci...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.64,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Oh, ce bine. S-a oprit...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.90,0:04:19.16,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Afemeiatule!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.99,0:04:23.66,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Afecțiunea lui Marika...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:23.66,0:04:28.25,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}s-a transformat în ceva de coșmar!
